sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Project Lead / Attack Host
    participant R as Route 53 Public DNS
    participant W as Public Web Target
    participant S as Splunk Enterprise
    participant L as LLM Bridge
    participant SOC as SOC Analyst
    participant IR as IR / Defender

    A->>R: Authorized A/AAAA/MX/NS/TXT enumeration
    R-->>A: DNS responses
    A->>W: Optional HTTPS follow-up
    W-->>S: Nginx/server telemetry
    S->>S: SPL detection / alert
    S->>L: Webhook alert context
    L-->>S: AI-assisted summary via HEC
    SOC->>S: Validate raw evidence
    SOC->>IR: Escalate if confirmed
    IR->>IR: Contain / reduce exposure / verify
